## 4. Key Components and Files

- **Database Definition**: [supabase_setup.sql](file:///c:/Users/Mala Mp/Desktop/agri/supabase_setup.sql) specifies the PostgreSQL tables, foreign key constraints, default values, mock data inserts, and Row-Level Security policies.
- **Supabase Integration**: [supabaseClient.js](file:///c:/Users/Mala Mp/Desktop/agri/src/supabaseClient.js) configures connection variables to push/pull records from the cloud.
- **Matching Rules**: [recommendationEngine.js](file:///c:/Users/Mala Mp/Desktop/agri/src/utils/recommendationEngine.js) handles logic to calculate soil health indicators and recommends appropriate organic/chemical fertilizers.
- **Multilingual Support**: [translations.js](file:///c:/Users/Mala Mp/Desktop/agri/src/utils/translations.js) holds translations for English and Kannada (Raita Mitra features).
- **Core View Layer**: [App.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Mala Mp/Desktop/agri/src/App.jsx) is the visual container linking forms, charts, reports, and the Chatbot interface.
